## 2. 3D WebGL & Rendering Loop Optimization

### GPU Visibility Throttling
- In [`CubeSatCanvas.jsx`](file:///C:/Users/RH364/OneDrive/Desktop/orbital%20desktop/OrbitalX/frontend/src/pages/studio/CubeSatCanvas.jsx):
  - Attached a `visibilitychange` listener that halts `requestAnimationFrame` render cycles when the browser tab is hidden (`document.hidden`).
  - Completely eliminates background GPU usage, fan spin, and thermal throttling when users switch tabs.

### Comprehensive Memory & Buffer Disposal
- Added recursive scene traversal on unmount in both 3D viewers:
  - Geometry buffers (`obj.geometry.dispose()`) and material programs (`obj.material.dispose()`) are explicitly reclaimed from VRAM to prevent WebGL context memory leaks.
  - Renderer contexts are properly torn down via `renderer.dispose()`.

### React Three Fiber Memoization
- In [`Scene.jsx`](file:///C:/Users/RH364/OneDrive/Desktop/orbital%20desktop/OrbitalX/frontend/src/components/three/Scene.jsx):
  - Cached spherical satellite positions and communication orbital arcs with `useMemo` to prevent re-computing trigonometry matrices on every render tick.

