## 3. Backend Data Retention & Simulation Efficiency

### Telemetry Sliding-Window Retention Policy
- In [`telemetrySimulator.js`](file:///C:/Users/RH364/OneDrive/Desktop/orbital%20desktop/OrbitalX/backend/src/services/telemetrySimulator.js):
  - Implemented an automatic sliding-window cap of **300 records per satellite**.
  - Older historical records are automatically culled, guaranteeing constant bounded database memory and predictable response times.

### Graceful Process Termination
- Attached `SIGINT` and `SIGTERM` process hooks to shut down database connections and clear interval timers gracefully upon server restarts.

